    "rationale": "Four coordinated moves contract the vertical extent by 2 tiles (y_max from 37→35) without moving input ports, directly exploiting vacancy hotspots at y=27–30 (window_21_27_27_29 and window_25_27_27_30). Nodes 13,15,16 shift down by 2 to align with empty band x=25–27,y=27–29 and reduce detour on edges [12,13], [12,15], [13,16]. Output node 3 moves down to y=35, preserving fanout geometry to 15 and 16 while eliminating the topmost tile row. All moved nodes remain collision-free; the new bounding box is min_x=20, max_x=28, min_y=20, max_y=35 → width=9, height=16, area=144 tiles, a strict improvement over current 162. Edge manhattan costs are preserved or reduced; no internal node is left unmoved."
